# Derived output; regenerate with `make demo`.
# EXCEPTIONS.md and RESULTS.md are committed on purpose: one is the honest half of the
# result, the other is the harness output verbatim, and the README quotes both.
# data/llm_cache/, data/resolutions.json, data/questions.json and data/pins.json ARE
# committed: the cache is what makes a rerun deterministic and free, the resolution log
# is the root of every provenance chain, and the question log and the pins are the
# operator's side of the reporting surface -- definitions, never numbers.
data/reconciliation.json
data/score.json
data/learning.json
data/rules.json
ui/public/tallytrace.json
